don't think there is,

00:06:00.766 --> 00:06:03.052
but if I don't do,
(laughs)

00:06:03.052 --> 00:06:05.526
but if it's not one of
the greatest car chases

00:06:05.526 --> 00:06:07.759
of all time then I failed
and there is a ceiling

00:06:07.759 --> 00:06:09.793
on my talent, I'm not as
good as I thought I was.

00:06:09.793 --> 00:06:11.738
And, I said that to everybody.

00:06:11.738 --> 00:06:13.116
And, was I scared?

00:06:13.116 --> 00:06:17.342
(bleep) yeah, I had
trepidation going all the way,

00:06:17.342 --> 00:06:19.093
'cause it's mine to fail.

00:06:19.093 --> 00:06:22.648
And, it's failing in
